:: Campus Library
<<initPlayState>>\
<<if !School.isSchoolDay()>><<goto "Linkon University">><</if>>\
<<run World.setLocation("campus-library", "Bloomshore District — Linkon University")>>\
You are in the library. Quiet shelves and study carrels give you room to catch up on classwork between periods — or after school, if the lights are still on.
<<schoolStudy>>

<<actionIcon "exit">><<link "Leave the library <span class='action-time'>(0:02)</span>">><<run World.advance(2)>><<goto "Linkon University">><</link>>
